{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20184","headline":"溧阳秋霁 · 孟郊","name":"溧阳秋霁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚雨晓犹在，萧寥激前阶。\n星星满衰鬓，耿耿入秋怀。\n旧识半零落，前心骤相乖。\n饱泉亦恐醉，惕宦肃如斋。\n上客处华池，下寮宅枯崖。\n叩高占生物，龃龉回难谐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}